Package: miadi-perms
Version: 0.1.0
Section: misc
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Depends: miadi-config (>= 0.2.0), findutils
Maintainer: Miadi <mia@jgwill.com>
Homepage: https://github.com/jgwill/miadi-orchestration-kit
Description: Group read and write on a Miadi host's shared session capture
 Several users' agent sessions write into one capture directory,
 MIADI_SESSIONDATA_ROOT (/src/_sessiondata by default). A file one user
 creates there is often not writable by the others, and their hooks then
 fail to write. The miadi-perms command gives the group read and write on
 every file under that directory that lacks it. The system timer
 miadi-perms.timer runs it as root every 4 hours, and once at boot when
 a run was missed. It is enabled at install.
